  "description": "<h2>What it does:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Shows all items compatible with the hovered item in both directions</li>\n<li>Hover over ammo → compatible magazines and guns light up</li>\n<li>Hover over a magazine → compatible guns and ammo light up</li>\n<li>Hover over a gun → compatible attachments, ammo, and magazines light up</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Key features:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Configurable highlight color (default: green)</li>\n<li>Adjustable hover delay before the highlight appears</li>\n<li>Can toggle container items (backpacks, rigs, cases) on or off</li>\n<li>Option to use vanilla highlighting when you’re actively dragging items</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Credits</h2>\n<p>Inspired by <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2823/acs-attachment-compatibility-highlight\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">AC’s - Attachment Compatibility Highlight</a>.</p>\n",
